al gener- ation of LLM, and overly long contexts can also lead LLM to the “Lost in the middle” problem [98]."},{"id":"c22","chunkId":"3a2ca388b4a2fb17_c_3d4a835702dbe7ce","docId":"3a2ca388b4a2fb17","docTitle":"2304.09542_Is_ChatGPT_Good_at_Search_Investigating_Large_Language_Models_as_Re_Ra","page":1,"quote":"Compared to the common generation settings, the objectives of relevance re-ranking vary signifi- cantly from those of LLMs: the re-ranking agents need to comprehend user requirements, globally compare, and rank the passages based on their"},{"id":"c23","chunkId":"3a2ca388b4a2fb17_c_9f24a805f3d657f3","docId":"3a2ca388b4a2fb17","docTitle":"2304.09542_Is_ChatGPT_Good_at_Search_Investigating_Large_Language_Models_as_Re_Ra","page":14,"quote":"Figure 2 (b) shows an example of instructional relevance generation, in which LLMs are instructed to output \"Yes\" if the query and passage are relevant or \"No\" if they are irrelevant."},{"id":"c24","chunkId":"23e3249e9a1e7541_c_06dea6d333690cf5","docId":"23e3249e9a1e7541","docTitle":"2005.11401_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Knowledge_Intensive_NLP_Tasks","page":15,"quote":"Retrieve and reﬁne: Improved sequence generation models for dialogue."},{"id":"c25","chunkId":"3a2ca388b4a2fb17_c_356f98a2884b9cf3","docId":"3a2ca388b4a2fb17","docTitle":"2304.09542_Is_ChatGPT_Good_at_Search_Investigating_Large_Language_Models_as_Re_Ra","page":2,"quote":"LLMs are also employed for training data generation."},{"id":"c26","chunkId":"01d82c67ac18ffc3_c_7838b27d7f75411d","docId":"01d82c67ac18ffc3","docTitle":"2404.03868_Extract_Define_Canonicalize_An_LLM_based_Framework_for_Knowledge_Graph","page":9,"quote":"Rebel: Relation extraction by end-to-end language generation."},{"id":"c27","chunkId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459_c_66a82cdc8c692609","docId":"737b0b8fe0aa8459","docTitle":"2501.00309_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_with_Graphs_GraphRAG","page":15,"quote":"A single fact is verbalized in the generation prompt as the tuple (entity 1, relation 1, 